  "summary": "从塔顶倒入香槟，每杯容量一，溢出部分平均流向下一行左右杯，求指定杯最终装满比例。",
  "insight": "按行传播每杯超过一的部分；查询行以下无需计算，使用一维数组从右向左更新避免覆盖本行仍需读取的值。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "只有 max(0,(amount-1)/2) 会流向每个子杯",
    "结果最多为一",
    "一维更新必须从当前行右端向左"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "row-compressed-overflow-dp",
      "title": "一维溢出动态规划",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "逐行把超过容量的部分分给下一行。",
      "steps": [
        "amount[0]=poured",
        "对 row<query_row，从 glass=row 到零倒序计算 overflow",
        "amount[glass]=overflow，amount[glass+1]+=overflow；最后返回 min(1,amount[query_glass])"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(query_row²)",
        "space": "O(query_row)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/row-compressed-overflow-dp/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/row-compressed-overflow-dp/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/row-compressed-overflow-dp/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
